  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of bisector of angle <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>)</mo></math> gives <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>  <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> gives <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>  <br/>therefore <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfies the above equation."
